@startuml Reservation Command Pattern

title Command Pattern - Reservation Operations

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

class UI <<Invoker>> {
    + createReservation()
    + payReservation()
    + cancelReservation()
}

interface Command <<Command>> {
    + execute(): void
}

class CreateReservationCommand <<ConcreteCommand>> {
    - reservationService: ReservationService
    - screeningId: Long
    - seatIds: List<Long>
    - email: String
    + execute(): void
}

class PayReservationCommand <<ConcreteCommand>> {
    - reservationService: ReservationService
    - reservationId: Long
    + execute(): void
}

class CancelReservationCommand <<ConcreteCommand>> {
    - reservationService: ReservationService
    - reservationId: Long
    + execute(): void
}

class ReservationService <<Receiver>> {
    + create(screeningId, seatIds, email): ReservationDto
    + confirm(id: Long): ReservationDto
    + cancel(id: Long): void
}

UI --> Command : executes

Command <|.. CreateReservationCommand
Command <|.. PayReservationCommand
Command <|.. CancelReservationCommand

CreateReservationCommand --> ReservationService
PayReservationCommand --> ReservationService
CancelReservationCommand --> ReservationService

note bottom of Command
    Encapsulates a user action
    as an independent object.
end note

note right of ReservationService
    Receiver containing the actual
    reservation business logic.
end note

@enduml